# Cursor Rules for AMG Pure-HTML Motion Graphics
- You are working in AMG (The Ultimate Pure-HTML Motion Graphics AI Ecosystem).
- All video animations are authored in pure HTML5, CSS3, SVG, and Vanilla JavaScript.
- No React, no Vue, no JSX in generated scenes.
- Follow the 7-stage isolated pipeline outlined in AMG_MASTER_ROUTER.md.
- Never write motion code in Stage 5 (Static Styleframes). Motion is strictly implemented in Stage 6.
- Always use `AMG.clock` and `AMG_EASES` from `core/` instead of bare CSS keyframes or uncontrolled requestAnimationFrame.
- Seekability via `window.seek(t)` is mandatory for all scenes.
